      "writtenOn": "2023-10-26T01:54:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Don\u0027t need this flag. The `_BUFFER_CLEAR` and the `_COMMIT` flags should be bit-wide, like BIT(0) and BIT(1) instead of using enum, so they can be embedded in a normal write command.\n\nFor example, the first-issued write command has the `_BUFFER_CLEAR` bit set; the last-issued write command has the `_COMMIT` set; all other commands in between have the flags cleared.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 519,
        "startChar": 25,
        "endLine": 519,
        "endChar": 53
      },
